# Privacy Policy

Last updated: 9 September 2026

This application is used solely by the owner for personal home automation purposes.

## Information Collected

This application may access Google account information and Google Smart Device Management (SDM) data required to communicate with Google Nest devices.

No personal information is collected, stored, shared, sold, or transferred to any third party.

## Use of Information

Any data accessed through Google's APIs is used exclusively to enable personal home automation features, including viewing device status and interacting with Google Nest devices.

## Data Storage

Authentication tokens and configuration data are stored only within the owner's private Home Assistant and Scrypted installations.

No information is transmitted to external services other than Google's APIs as required for device communication.

## Data Sharing

No data is shared with third parties.

